## Status

Self-excluded: **no verified public benchmark numbers** were found for the exact model/ID `grok-4.20` / `x-ai/grok-4.20` in accessible sources at time of research.

## Research notes

- Accessible metadata (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists Grok 4.20 0309 v2 (Reasoning) as a proprietary SpaceXAI model (released April 2026, deprecated in AA view), supporting text/image input and text output, with 2M-token context window and pricing around $1.25/$2.50 per 1M tokens (cache discount 84%) in AA snapshots. OpenRouter lists `x-ai/grok-4.20` with provider routing and supported parameters.
- Artificial Analysis reported Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, MMMU, Terminal-Bench, AIME, LiveCodeBench, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

